{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d5cf3a4d-e767-8f08-a6ee-a159b6fabc62",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T14:12:22-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gerard Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:10:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:10:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Gerard Sullivan calling. Let me explain what's going on. I own a rental at 71 Rhode Island Avenue, up on the Hill, and the catch basin at the corner is clogged solid with leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:10:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it backing up now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:10:50-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. After the coastal storm, the one Friday into Saturday, three days ago, the water came up out of that drain and ran into the driveway. It's still sitting there. Every time it rains this happens and nobody has come to clear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:11:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, that's a nuisance. Is it getting into the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:11:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not the house, no, just the driveway and the street. And the cars are slowing to a crawl going through it. Somebody's going to get stuck, or splash a tenant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:11:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on. [pause] My son is whispering at me. He says tell you it's right by the stop sign. Yes, I'm getting to that. It's at the corner by the stop sign."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:11:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That helps, tell him thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:11:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now, my question. Is that a city drain or a state one? Because I called once before about it and I couldn't tell who was supposed to handle it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:11:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On a local street like Rhode Island Avenue, it's normally the city's. I'll put in a work order for the crew to clear that catch basin. Can I get a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:11:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, zero one nine two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:11:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Crews are stretched thin after the storm, so I can't give you a day, but it's logged for the corner at 71 Rhode Island Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:12:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'd just like it actually cleaned this time. It keeps happening and the leaves just sit there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:12:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. If it gets worse, call us right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:12:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you, Denise."
    }
  ],
